# TradeOps environment variables
#
# Nothing here is required. There are no API keys to obtain and no account to
# create: candles and tickers come from Binance, Bybit, Coinbase, Kraken, OKX
# and Crypto.com's public endpoints, and the on-chain panels work as-is.
#
# --- Optional ---
#
# Ethereum JSON-RPC endpoints for the on-chain panels (whale feed, holders,
# token transfers). Comma-separated, tried in order. Defaults to four public
# endpoints, which are fine for a local run or a light instance — see
# /legal/sources for who runs them and what their terms say.
#
# Point it at your own node (Alchemy, Infura, QuickNode, geth/reth on your own
# hardware) before running real traffic:
# ETH_RPC_URLS=https://your-node.example.com,https://backup.example.com
#
# Or switch the on-chain panels off entirely, so the app does not lean on
# anybody else's hardware at all:
# ETH_RPC_URLS=off
#
# An empty or unparseable value falls back to the public defaults rather than
# silently disabling the panels; `off` is the only way to disable them.
